  "limitations": [
    "Two report-metadata requests for the seeded student thesis returned 404. No report upload/download/recovery acceptance is claimed.",
    "No appeal or curriculum-default batch was submitted; their empty/demo views are genuine.",
    "The initial capture stopped before authenticated screens because login was clicked before hydration. Login now waits for settlement; authenticated captures were rerun.",
    "Specialized assistant was recaptured with a technical-domain question appropriate to its corpus. No external provider call was enabled.",
    "The seeded database reconcile job reported section-count drift with automatic repair disabled. Capture did not repair business fixtures or test enrollment mutations.",
    "Build dependencies reported an npm audit finding. Dependency remediation and a security certification are outside this documentation update.",
    "Local rendering and authenticated reads are not full mutation, load, mobile-device, live-provider, CI or production acceptance.",
    "The existing lecturer mail UI displays a literal {max} placeholder in its recipient summary. Captures preserve it; product-copy repair is outside this docs-only scope."
